    {
      "id": "nowinandroid-q1",
      "answer": "Now in Android is an Android-development news app and a reference implementation of Android design/development practices. Android developers run it to browse videos, articles and other series content, follow topics, and receive matching-content notifications; developers studying app construction learn from its code and learning journeys. The README describes Kotlin/Compose, a Play Store prodRelease, and locally runnable demo variants; the production backend is not publicly available.",
