    {
      "id": "nowinandroid-q2",
      "answer": "Principal components: app/MainActivity/NiaApp assemble the application, adaptive shell and navigation; feature implementations provide For You/onboarding, Interests, Bookmarks, Topic, Search and Settings UI/state. The data layer exposes repositories, with Room database storage, network data sources and DataStore preferences; domain use cases combine/transform repository data; Compose screens and ViewModels consume state and send events downward. Shared core:model, core:common, core:designsystem and core:ui provide models, utilities, theme/components and reusable model-rendering UI. sync:work handles synchronization; testing/benchmarks support validation; app-nia-catalog demonstrates the design system.",
