      "id": "nowinandroid-q4",
      "answer": "For the selected main app, Android's MAIN/LAUNCHER intent resolves the exported .MainActivity in app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml. The application class is .NiaApplication: its onCreate initializes Sync and the profile verifier. MainActivity is an @AndroidEntryPoint ComponentActivity; onCreate installs the splash screen, calls super, observes theme state and uses setContent to construct app state and invoke NiaTheme { NiaApp(appState) }. Android lifecycle/Hilt invocation is a framework boundary, not a repository main() function. This is the app launcher, not app-nia-catalog.",
