      "answer": "core:data directly declares six production project dependencies: api(core:common), api(core:database), api(core:datastore), api(core:network), implementation(core:analytics), implementation(core:notifications). core:datastore-test and core:testing are testImplementation only. This is the explicit project dependency block, not a claim that transitive or convention-plugin dependencies are direct declarations; core:model is not explicitly declared there.",
